    {
      "id": "claim_b9b9101a12e64cb8851d87e4dc67b3e7",
      "statement": "On top of the per-pattern recurrence test there is a coverage alarm (ALARME_COBERTURA = 0.05): if the X_sintoma_nao_reconhecido bucket exceeds 5% of all errors in a base, it is promoted to 'revisar — prioridade' even without a recurring pattern — the signal that the taxonomy does not cover the base, not just a stray error.",
