    {
      "id": "claim_522813ffd21949cca971701f12965565",
      "statement": "triagem_por_papel() runs the same triage rule (>=3 executions, >=2 months, deduplicated cascade occurrences) inside each agent role for memory-scoped candidacy — only factual/experiential units are eligible; platform, residual and harness-destination units are excluded by design; with the consolidated silenciosas input, a role's executions/months count the union of both channels. Global vs per-role verdicts yield four states per (role, unit) cell: firme, herdada, revelada, fora; 'revelada' is impossible by construction under the same rule (a role's executions/months are subsets of the base's). On base 1: 18 of 31 cells firme, 13 herdada, 0 revelada, 8 of 18 flip under the stricter >=5/>=3 rule (7 since the consolidation — one cell gained the silent channel).",
