      "statement": "Since the consolidation (Ajuste 12, consolidacao_unidades.ipynb §14.x), the visible and silent buckets enter the same triage: ocorrencias_visiveis() and ocorrencias_silenciosas() emit one common format (exec_id, role, idx, mes, unidade, ocorrencia, canal) with occurrence = cascade x unit in both channels, and triagem(silenciosas=...) counts occurrences, executions, months and roles as the union of the two channels — while errors, tokens and cascade stay visible-only; without the parameter the output is unchanged.",
